# Visualizer source — excluded from npm tarball (D2 lock, 2026-05-23 plan)
# Reason: docs/visualizer/ is a Vite + TypeScript build artifact scope.
# Including it would leak dev-only tsconfig/vite.config + bloat the tarball
# beyond the alpha.11 baseline + 1MB delta guard.
# Counterpart CI assertion: .github/workflows/harness-validate.yml
# (tarball-size-guard job).
#
# Multiple syntactic forms for cross-version npm robustness
# (initial single-form `docs/visualizer/` failed CI tarball-size-guard
# 2026-05-23T05:29 — see commit 347e6c1 fail log).
docs/visualizer
docs/visualizer/
docs/visualizer/**
**/docs/visualizer
**/docs/visualizer/**
/docs/visualizer
/docs/visualizer/
/docs/visualizer/**

# Hero overview PNG — 루트 GitHub README 전용 자산
# 루트 README.md / README.ko.md 만 참조하고, 패키지 내부 README 는
# hero.gif / demo-terminal.svg 를 쓰므로 npm tarball 에 포함될 필요가 없다.
# npmjs.com 의 README 이미지는 GitHub repo raw URL 로 가져오므로
# tarball 제외해도 렌더링에 영향 없음.
# Counterpart CI assertion: .github/workflows/harness-validate.yml
# (tarball-size-guard, alpha.11 baseline + 1MB delta).
docs/assets/overview-*.png
/docs/assets/overview-*.png
**/docs/assets/overview-*.png
